{title: Tu Tenva Tashi}
{artist: Hridaynath Mangeshkar}
{key: D#}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#]Tu..... [G#]
[A#]tevha tashi,
[F]tu.... [A#]
[F]tevha [D#]ashi,
[D#]tu [F]baharanchya [A#]bahunchi
[D#]Tu..... [G#]
[D#]tu [A#]yel radha,
[F]tu [A#]pail sandhya,
[D#]chafekali [F]premachi [A#]
[D#]Tu..... [G#]
[D#]tu [Cm]navijuni,
[Gm]tu [D#]kadhi kuni
[D#]kharichya [F]ga, [A#]dolyanchi
[D#]Tu..... [G#]
[A#]tu [D#]harvikchhi, [A#]
[A#]tu [F]pokta [A#]sachhi,
[D#]tu [F]khttimithhi [A#]othanchi
[D#]Tu..... [G#]
tu kuni pakshi pisanvar nakshi,        kavitechya ishwarachi
